WEBVTT

00:00:58.316 --> 00:01:02.716
by exploring how relationships
matter in our lives,

00:01:02.756 --> 00:01:04.596
how they affect our health,

00:01:04.636 --> 00:01:09.756
what kinds of relationships
give us this big benefit in happiness,

00:01:09.796 --> 00:01:16.196
and which tools you can start using today
to make your relationship stronger.

00:01:18.836 --> 00:01:22.116
So I do direct this Harvard Study
of Adult Development.

00:01:22.116 --> 00:01:26.556
It's, as far as we know,
the longest study of the same people

00:01:26.596 --> 00:01:31.716
that's ever been done,
following people since 1938.